'''Hau''' (Japanese: '''ハウ''' ''Hau'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks by your {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Decidueye ex|12|Decidueye '''''<big>ex</big>''''' }}, {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Incineroar ex|33|Incineroar '''''<big>ex</big>'''''}}, or {{TCG ID|Eevee Grove|Primarina ex|24|Primarina '''''<big>ex</big>'''''}} do +30 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

